    "created_at": "2016-02-10T15:08:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-10T15:08:12Z",
    "body": "Could you be a bit more specific? It includes plenty of phrases like \"If the new value is an IPv4 or IPv6 address\", with the definition \"If the document's domain starts with a U+005B LEFT SQUARE BRACKET character ([) and ends with a U+005D RIGHT SQUARE BRACKET character (]), it is an IPv6 address\".\n\nWhat is some example code setting or getting document.domain that you think the spec is unclear on how to process?\n",
